SUMMARY:Viola Vainglory presents BURLESK: FIFTH ANNIVERSARY!
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a little spice for your Wednesday night? Join us as we celebrate FIVE years of up close and personal burlesque shows at Sid’s! We’ll have SIX performers this week\, instead of our usual three\, and we’re revisiting all the things that make the show great. We’ll have all kinds of burlesque: a sing-n-strip\, improv\, nerdlesque\, a new performer\, an act from our show founder and a traveling showpony! \nBe seduced by the sparkle! This week only: *7:30 start + double the acts\, double the fun! (*Bar opens at 6\, reservations open at 6:30) \n$20 ticket (purchase here in advance to guarantee seating!) Walk-ins welcome ($20 cover added to tab)\, but seating not guaranteed. Two item minimum for table/piano seating. \nSponsored by\n \nTIP YOUR PERFORMERS!! Venmo @ViolaVainglory \n  \n  \nHost: Viola Vainglory\n \n 
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/viola-vainglory-presents-burlesk-fifth-anniversary/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nashville Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Poster.png
END:VEVENT
