SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Eliot Hinson
DESCRIPTION:CHOOSE FROM ELIOT’S SONG LIST\nMAKE A REQUEST!\nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @Eliot-Hinson \nA native to the Nashville area\, Eliot Hinson is a full-time musician working primarily as a collaborative pianist with singers\, instrumentalists\, and choral ensembles. His work spans jazz\, pop\, classical and commercial styles. With his background as a band director\, orchestral conductor\, and brass player\, and training in both classical and jazz piano – he is ready for all kinds of music making at just about any time of day\, as long as he’s had his coffee.
