SUMMARY:Gavin McCormick: Piece Of Sh*t At The Center Of The Universe
DESCRIPTION:Addiction. Recovery. Pain. Hope. A cabaret journey in songs from the ’70s to today\, with Gavin McCormick (vocals) and Ben Easton (piano)\n\nPerformances of pop\, rock\, country\, and blues songs\, along with short personal essays\, telling a story of one man’s addiction and recovery. Performed at the beautiful Sid Gold’s Request Room in Chelsea.\n\nNote:The show concerns sexual themes with potentially triggering content for trauma survivors.\n\nTickets here!
